# Introduction # {#introduction}

In 2026-05, the C++ Library Evolution group conducted an electronic poll [[P4225R0]].
This paper provides the results of this poll and summarizes the responses.

In total, XX people participated in the polls.
Thank you to everyone who participated, and to the papers' authors for all their hard work!

# Poll Outcomes # {#poll-outcomes}

* SF: Strongly Favor.
* WF: Weakly Favor.
* N: Neutral.
* WA: Weakly Against.
* SA: Strongly Against.

